---
name: Web A11y (Extended)
description: WCAG 2.2 + Bootstrap-specific checks
---

[Verwende deinen bestehenden wcag.prompt als Base]

**Bootstrap-Specific A11y Issues:**
- **Modal keyboard traps** (focus management)
- **Carousel accessibility** (pause controls, screen reader announcements)
- **Dropdown keyboard navigation** (arrow keys, Esc)
- **Form validation** (aria-invalid, error announcements)
- **Button vs link usage** (semantic correctness)
- **Missing aria-label on icon-only buttons**

**11ty Build-Time Checks:**
- **Missing alt text** (can be checked at build time)
- **Invalid HTML** (W3C validation)
- **Missing lang attributes**
